<refnamediv>
  <refname><function>SilikoNodeCreateFromReal</function></refname>
  <refpurpose>Function to create a new real leaf node</refpurpose>
</refnamediv>

<refsynopsisdiv>
<programlisting language="C">#include &lt;SilikoCore/Node.h&gt;</programlisting>
<programlisting language="C">SilikoNode *SilikoNodeCreateFromReal(double source);</programlisting>
</refsynopsisdiv>

<refsection>
<title>Description</title>
<para>The <function>SilikoNodeCreateFromReal</function> function
generates a new real-number leaf node from <varname>source</varname>
value.</para>
</refsection>

<refsection>
<title>Return Values</title>

<para><function>SilikoNodeCreateFromReal</function> returns a pointer to
a new leaf <type>SilikoNode</type> object with the value passed on
success, or <literal>NULL</literal> if there was a memory error.</para>
</refsection>
